    {
      "sentence": "Therefore, it meets the criteria for a score of 5.",
      "error_type": "rubric_misapplication",
      "explanation": "Per the scoring rubric, a score of 3 applies when the comment explicitly states an action but is vague on how to execute it, which matches this comment. The rationale incorrectly applies the rubric threshold for a score of 5, which requires both explicit action and concrete implementation details."
    }
  ],
  "overall_basis": "The rationale misreads the evaluated text to incorrectly claim it contains concrete implementation details, then misapplies the scoring rubric to arrive at an incorrect score of 5, so it supports the wrong score."
